00:01:08.566 --> 00:01:10.099
Basically from the line draft

00:01:10.533 --> 00:01:14.099
The process of moving to monochrome and then full color

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:18.700
This is essentially the process of classical oil painting

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.066
