00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:40.066
For example, the painting process of contemporary oil painter Osamu Ogao

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:43.566
It is to draw a complete sketch from the line sketch first

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:45.800
And then I'll do it again with a solid base color

00:01:45.866 --> 00:01:48.199
At this point go back and draw the sketch again

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.133
